m);\n00395|     }\n00396|     if (((_initiativeState.lastEpochClaim + UNREGISTRATION_AFTER_EPOCHS) < (currentEpoch - 1)) || ((_votesForInitiativeSnapshot.vetos > _votesForInitiativeSnapshot.votes) && (_votesForInitiativeSnapshot.vetos > ((votingTheshold * UNREGISTRATION_THRESHOLD_FACTOR) / WAD)))) {\n00397|         return (InitiativeStatus.UNREGISTERABLE, lastEpochClaim, 0);\n00398|     }\n00399|     return (InitiativeStatus.SKIP, lastEpochClaim, 0);\n00400| }\n00401| ```\n00402| \n00403| ### calculateVotingThreshold(uint256)\n00404| \n00405| - **Kind**: internal\n00406| - **Source**: 11889:442:67\n00407| - **Link**: `src/Governance.sol:Governance:calculateVotingThreshold(uint256)`\n00408| \n00409| ```solidity\n00410| /// @inheritdoc IGovernance\n00411| function calculateVotingThreshold(uint256 _votes) public view returns (uint256) {\n00412|     if (_votes == 0) return 0;\n00413|     uint256 minVotes;\n00414|     uint256 payoutPerVote = (boldAccrued * WAD) / _votes;\n00415|     if (payoutPerVote != 0) {\n00416|         minVotes = (MIN_CLAIM * WAD) / payoutPerVote;\n00417|     }\n00418|     return max((_votes * VOTING_THRESHOLD_FACTOR) / WAD, minVotes);\n00419| }\n00420| ```\n00421| \n00422| ### max(uint256,uint256)\n00423| \n00424| - **Kind**: free-function\n00425| - **Source**: 336:87:85\n00426| - **Link**: `src/utils/Math.sol:max(uint256,uint256)`\n00427| \n00428| ```solidity\n00429| function max(uint256 a, uint256 b) pure returns (uint256) {\n00430|     return (a > b) ? a : b;\n00431| }\n00432| ```\n00433| \n00434| ### add(uint256,int256)\n00435| \n00436| - **Kind**: free-function\n00437| - **Source**: 58:137:85\n00438| - **Link**: `src/utils/Math.sol:add(uint256,int256)`\n00439| \n00440| ```solidity\n00441| function add(uint256 a, int256 b) pure returns (uint256) {\n00442|     if (b < 0) {\n00443|         return a - abs(b);\n00444|     }\n00445|     return a + uint256(b);\n00446| }\n00447| ```\n00448| \n00449| ### abs(int256)\n00450| \n00451| - **Kind**: free-fu