Governance.sol:Governance:_increaseUserVoteTrackers(uint256)`\n00042| \n00043| ```solidity\n00044| function _increaseUserVoteTrackers(uint256 _lqtyAmount) private returns (UserProxy) {\n00045|     require(_lqtyAmount > 0, \"Governance: zero-lqty-amount\");\n00046|     address userProxyAddress = deriveUserProxyAddress(msg.sender);\n00047|     if (userProxyAddress.code.length == 0) {\n00048|         deployUserProxy();\n00049|     }\n00050|     UserProxy userProxy = UserProxy(payable(userProxyAddress));\n00051|     userStates[msg.sender].unallocatedLQTY += _lqtyAmount;\n00052|     userStates[msg.sender].unallocatedOffset += block.timestamp * _lqtyAmount;\n00053|     return userProxy;\n00054| }\n00055| ```\n00056| \n00057| ### deriveUserProxyAddress(address)\n00058| \n00059| - **Kind**: internal\n00060| - **Source**: 579:194:70\n00061| - **Link**: `src/UserProxyFactory.sol:UserProxyFactory:deriveUserProxyAddress(address)`\n00062| \n00063| ```solidity\n00064| /// @inheritdoc IUserProxyFactory\n00065| function deriveUserProxyAddress(address _user) public view returns (address) {\n00066|     return Clones.predictDeterministicAddress(userProxyImplementation, bytes32(uint256(uint160(_user))));\n00067| }\n00068| ```\n00069| \n00070| ### predictDeterministicAddress(address,bytes32)\n00071| \n00072| - **Kind**: internal\n00073| - **Source**: 3930:227:35\n00074| - **Link**: `lib/openzeppelin-contracts/contracts/proxy/Clones.sol:Clones:predictDeterministicAddress(address,bytes32)`\n00075| \n00076| ```solidity\n00077| ///  @dev Computes the address of a clone deployed using {Clones-cloneDeterministic}.\n00078| function predictDeterministicAddress(address implementation, bytes32 salt) internal view returns (address predicted) {\n00079|     return predictDeterministicAddress(implementation, salt, address(this));\n00080| }\n00081| ```\n00082| \n00083| ### predictDeterministicAddress(address,bytes32,address)\n00084| \n00085| - **Kind**: internal\n00086| - **Source**: 3140:680:35\n00087| - **Link**: `lib/openzeppelin-contracts/contracts/proxy/Clones.sol:Clones:predictDeterministicAddress(address,bytes32,address)`\n00088| \n00089| ```solidity\n00090| ///  @dev Computes the address of a clone deployed using {Clones-cloneDeterministic}.\n00091| function predictDeterministicAddress(address implementation, bytes32 salt, address deployer) internal pure returns (address predicted) {\n00092|     /// @solidity memory-safe-assembly\n00093|     assembly {\n00094|         let ptr := mload(0x40)\n00095|         mstore(add(ptr, 0x38), deployer)\n00096|         mstore(add(ptr, 0x24), 0x5af43d82803e903d91602b57fd5bf3ff)\n00097|         mstore(add(ptr, 0x14), implementation)\n00098|         mstore(ptr, 0x3d602d80600a3d3981f3363d3d373d3d3d363d73)\n00099|         mstore(add(ptr, 0x58), salt)\n00100|         mstore(add(ptr, 0x78), keccak256(add(ptr, 0x0c), 0x37))\n00101|         predicted := keccak256(add(ptr, 0x43), 0x55)\n00102|     }\n00103| }\n00104| ```\n00105| \n00106| ### deployUserProxy()\n00107| \n00108| - **Kind**: internal\n00109| - **Source**: 817:310:70\n00110| - **Link**: `src/UserProxyFactory.sol:UserProxyFactory:deployUserProxy()`\n00111| \n00112| ```solidity\n00113| /// @inheritdoc IUserProxyFactory\n00114| function deployUserProxy() public returns (address) {\n00115|     address userProxy = Clones.cloneDeterministic(userProxyImplementation, bytes32(uint256(uint160(msg.sender))));\n00116|     emit DeployUserProxy(msg.sender, userProxy);\n00117|     return userProxy;\n00118| }\n00119| ```\n00120| \n00121| ### cloneDeterministic(address,bytes32)\n00122| \n00123| - **Kind**: internal\n00124| - **Source**: 2209:821:35\n00125| - **Link**: `lib/openzeppelin-contracts/contracts/proxy/Clones.sol:Clones:cloneDeterministic(address,bytes32)`\n00126| \n00127| ```solidity\n00128| ///  @dev Deploys and returns the address of a clone that mimics the behaviour of `implementation`.\n00129| ///  This function uses the create2 opcode and a `salt` to deterministically deploy\n00130| ///  the clone. Using the same `implementation` and `salt` multiple time will revert, since\n00131| ///  the clones cannot be deployed twice at the same address.\n00132| function cloneDeterministic(address implementation, bytes32 salt) internal returns (address instance) {\n00133|     /// @solidity memory-safe-assembly\n00134|     assembly {\n00135|         mstore(0x00, or(shr(0xe8, shl(0x60, implementation)), 0x3d602d80600a3d3981f3363d3d373d3d3d363d73000000))\n00136|         mstore(0x20, or(shl(0x78, implementation), 0x5af43d82803e903d91602b57fd5bf3))\n00137|         instance := create2(0, 0x09, 0x37, salt)\n00138|     }\n00139|     if (instance == address(0)) {\n00140|         revert ERC1167FailedCreateClone();\n00141|     }\n00142| }\n00143| ```\n00144| \n00145| ### nonReentrant()\n00146| \n00147| - **Kind**: modifier\n00148| - **Source**: 2322:103:45\n00149| - **Link**: `lib/openzeppelin-contracts/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol:ReentrancyGuard:nonReentrant()`\n00150| \n00151| ```solidity\n00152| ///  @dev Prevents a contract from calling itself, directly or indirectly.\n00153| ///  Calling a `nonReentrant` function from another `nonReentrant`\n00154| ///  function is not supported. It is possible to prevent this from happening\n00155| ///  by making the `nonReentrant` function external, and making it call a\n00156| ///  `private` function that does the actual work.\n00157| modifier nonReentrant() {\n00158|     _nonReentrantBefore();\n00159|     _;\n00160|     _nonReentrantAfter();\n00161| }\n00162| ```\n00163| \n00164| ### _nonReentrantBefore()\n00165| \n00166| - **Kind**: internal\n00167| - **Source**: 2431:307:45\n00168| - **Link**: `lib/openzeppelin-contracts/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol:ReentrancyGuard:_nonReentrantBefore()`\n00169| \n00170| ```solidity\n00171| function _nonReentrantBefore() private {\n00172|     if (_status == ENTERED) {\n00173|         revert ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall();\n00174|     }\n00175|     _status = ENTERED;\n00176| }\n00177| ```\n00178| \n00179| ### _nonReentrantAfter()\n00180| \n00181| - **Kind**: internal\n00182| - **Source**: 2744:208:45\n00183| - **Link**: `lib/openzeppelin-contracts/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol:ReentrancyGuard:_nonReentrantAfter()`\n00184| \n00185| ```solidity\n00186| function _nonReentrantAfter() private {\n00187|     _status = NOT_ENTERED;\n00188| }\n00189| ```\n00190| \n00191| ## State Variable Reads\n00192| \n00193| - **userProxyImplementation** (`address`)\n00194| - **_status** (`uint256`)\n00195| - **ENTERED** (`uint256`)\n00196| - **NOT_ENTERED** (`uint256`)\n00197| \n00198| ## State Variable Writes\n00199| \n00200| - **userStates** (`mapping(address => struct IGovernance.UserState)`)\n00201| - **_status** (`uint256`)\n00202| \n00203| ## Call Tree\n00204| \n00205| ```\n00206| ┌─ [0] ⚙️ FUNCTION: Governance.depositLQTY(uint256) (NodeID: 0)\n00207|     💬 Args: [no args]\n00208|     👁️  Def: external\n00209|   └─ [1] ⚙️ FUNCTION: Governance.depositLQTY(uint256,bool,address) (NodeID: 1)\n00210|       💬 Args: [_lqtyAmount, false, msg.sender]\n00211|       👁️  Def: public\n00212|     ├─ [2] ⚙️ FUNCTION: Governance._increaseUserVoteTrackers(uint256) (NodeID: 2)\n00213|     │   💬 Args: [_lqtyAmount]\n00214|     │   👁️  Def: private\n00215|     │ ├─ [3] ⚙️ FUNCTION: UserProxyFactory.deriveUserProxyAddress(address) (NodeID: 3)\n00216|     │ │   💬 Args: [msg.sender]\n00217|     │ │   👁️  Def: public\n00218|     │ │ └─ [4] ⚙️ FUNCTION: Clones.predictDeterministicAddress(address,bytes32) (NodeID: 4)\n00219|     │ │     💬 Args: [userProxyImplementation, bytes32(uint256(uint160(_user)))]\n00220|     │ │     👁️  Def: internal\n00221|     │ │   └─ [5] ⚙️ FUNCTION: Clones.predictDeterministicAddress(address,bytes32,address) (NodeID: 5)\n00222|     │ │       💬 Args: [implementation, salt, address(this)]\n00223|     │ │       👁️  Def: internal\n00224|     │ └─ [3] ⚙️ FUNCTION: UserProxyFactory.deployUserProxy() (NodeID: 6)\n00225|     │     💬 Args